{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261126%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E9%87%8D%E9%BB%9E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E9%80%9F%E8%A6%BD_01-1024x1024.png\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>🔸高等法院<br/>► 1130　34庭　法官郭啟安<br/>6男與14歲女童非法性交罪案｜求情及判刑<br/>► 1000　10庭　暫委法官祁彥輝<br/>蔡天鳳案　前夫、家翁及大伯否認謀殺罪｜續審<br/>► 1500　23庭　上訴庭法官彭偉昌及楊家雄、法官陳慶偉<br/>11.18理大衝突　科學館廣場外非法集結罪成女子上訴被駁回｜宣布判決理由</p>\n<p>🔸區域法院<br/>► 1000　25庭　暫委法官鄧少雄<br/>興達大廈大維修圍標案｜續審</p>\n<p>🔸沙田法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　裁判官黃國輝<br/>涉中大校園內醉駕撞車後不顧而去　前立法會議員黃錦輝認4罪｜判刑<br/>► 0930　6庭　裁判官陳志輝<br/>六旬男子否認城巴上以飛機杯搖晃下體｜續審</p>\n<p>🔸粉嶺法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　裁判官梁雅忻<br/>宏福苑五級火　訛稱曾為屋苑居民圖騙援助金　無業男被控企圖欺詐罪｜再提堂</p>\n<p>🔸西九龍法院<br/>► 0930　14庭　主任裁判官蘇文隆<br/>狗隻訓練員涉上門訓練時虐狗｜再提堂<br/>差估署男工人涉窺淫｜再提堂</p>\n<hr/>\n<p>「重點法庭案件速覽」是根據法庭日誌內，我們認為大眾會關注的翌日案件，選取出來以方便讀者閱覽</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n<p></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T15:03:57.833722+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":478,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T14:42:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T12:17:16.477044+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T14:57:17.956735+00:00","content_hash":"06b69412bd9711093dc5bbcfea199aee2c95cf464f43e17f49cafae95ee2934e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}